{"id":23116,"author":"FLUFFY_PIE","body":"So a while ago I got banned for supposed grefing/trolling/blocking people in spawn or something, and i got banned for ever and i was wondering if this could be undone?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks FLUFFY_PIE","body_tagged":"So a while ago I got banned for supposed grefing/trolling/blocking people in spawn or something, and i got banned for ever and i was wondering if this could be undone?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThanks FLUFFY_PIE","created_at":1468485120,"title":"I got banned from someone elses doings!","replies":[{"id":317868,"author":"Junr","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eHello! The Staff Member who punished you is no longer Staff, so I will escalate your appeal and only Senior Moderators will be the only staff responding after this post. Good Luck on your appeal! Thank you for your patience! :)\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\"\u003eHello! The Staff Member who punished you is no longer Staff, so I will escalate your appeal and only Senior Moderators will be the only staff responding after this post. Good Luck on your appeal! Thank you for your patience! :)\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1468488522},{"id":317872,"author":"FLUFFY_PIE","body":"Okay, Thanks","body_tagged":"Okay, Thanks","created_at":1468491738,"reply_to":317868},{"id":317879,"author":"GrapeSmoothie","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHey FLUFFY_PIE,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);